flowchart LR
    Package[Verified runtime package] --> Prepare[Prepare platform isolation]
    Policy[Loopback-only policy] --> Prepare
    Prepare --> Launch[Launch suspended or inside boundary]
    Launch --> Tree[Retained process tree]
    Tree --> Ollama[Version-gated cloud-disabled Ollama]
    Ollama --> Canaries[Local allow and non-loopback deny canaries]
    Canaries --> Reobserve[Reobserve policy and process lifecycle]
    Reobserve --> Evidence[Isolation plus provider evidence]
    Evidence --> Qualify[Eligible for later qualification]
